{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53453","headline":"历山 · 羊士谔","name":"历山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按：《全唐诗》卷三三二收此二句，缺题，今重录。\n）风泉（《历代诗话续编》本《诗人主客图》作「前」）留古颜（《全唐诗》作「韵」），笙磬想遗音。\n（见汲古阁本《唐诗纪事》卷四三引《诗人主客图》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}